Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn on forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.26,0:00:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting bones,\Nwe'll reach it, we are home!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.94,0:00:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so truly grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ran into you on that day so long ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We laughed every moment\Nwith tears in our eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we knew we weren't alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.42,0:00:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The blowing wind came in\Nand joined us on our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And with it I know we'll rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be flying up high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why are you giving up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.44,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, tell me why you want to fight alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what kind of future\Ndo you think you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.88,0:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dream is already in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This love in my heart,\Nit will burn off forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Granting me courage, I\Nhope it will never stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.84,0:01:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't matter where you\Nare, nothing is too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.98,0:01:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With our everlasting\Nplans, we'll reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We are home from the horizon,\Nout on the edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.60,0:01:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is a place that\NI'd want to take you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way, we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.54,0:01:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.36,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You scream by your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't break through the silence?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.32,0:01:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It crushes your helpless heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.12,0:01:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back. I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put our fate within\Nthis light under the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you close your eyes and\Njust listen to my voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's find the answer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, in our path.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.66,0:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I trust that it will lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,To another sea untarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.60,0:02:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause now we are home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,On the horizon, out on\Nthe edge of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place I want to take you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.30,0:02:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head for it then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But as for the way we already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.14,0:02:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We promised it long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really gonna wait here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We're right in the middle\Nof enemy territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what Pound said?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,About the last person who\Ntook out a sweet general?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.86,0:02:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom summoned a storm along\Nwith an army hungry for revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and their target didn't survive an instant\Nso we know that the enemy will come,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.62,0:02:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but Sanji on the other\Nhand, Sanji will be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:03:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wait just like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Chess look at mine, handsome foliage,\Nit's been ruined, chopped down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was clear only a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are those clouds coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.54,0:03:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,kingbaum, what's causing all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming from the whole\Ncake. Shit. Where mama lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Her fury is tremendous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.98,0:03:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then those clouds—are
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.00,0:03:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.91,0:03:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.26,0:03:49.09,Default,,0,0,0,,way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.17,0:03:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that power—coming from
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.78,0:03:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,one person!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My climate
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,tax can't hold a candle\Nto something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Linlin can
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.46,0:04:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,command the weather quite literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.40,0:04:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,quite literally
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.02,0:04:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Once her rage is awakened, there's\Nnothing in this world that can stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.40,0:04:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeus and Prometheus are\Nrunning wild up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.70,0:05:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Clear the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The forces of fury are marching!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They're off to avenge General Cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:45.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.58,0:05:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, you idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.72,0:06:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A whole army!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're hunting down Straw Hat, no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The rat's as good as dead now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.56,0:06:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't run because he's\Nwaiting for his old pal Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.68,0:06:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing you said your goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.06,0:06:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Bobbin the Disposer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Amand the Mademoiselle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And Mondor the Scribe!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder how much all\Nthose bounties add up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm staying right here and\NI'm not moving on a hitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.98,0:06:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:06:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even Straw Hat wouldn't\Nbe stupid enough to
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.78,0:07:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,sit around after getting\Na load of that army.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.64,0:07:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,syrup, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.92,0:07:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't eat syrup or anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.84,0:07:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,not unless Sanji's the one cooking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:07:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.54,0:08:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you being good, boys and girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, I've got a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Inanna?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The head chef's being mean\Nand won't let me use a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.26,0:08:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna cut open my dolly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't do at all, will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dials and Dragé,\Ngo and get her a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, no how, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She says she wants to cut her dolly,\Nbut she's gonna pop our balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's a bad girl, and I'm\Ngonna kill her someday for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.72,0:08:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, kill her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.00,0:08:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We shouldn't say mean things like\Nthat to each other, should we, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.86,0:08:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.46,0:08:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.26,0:08:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has a couple hundred\Npeople that they want dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But let's hold off on the\Nkilling for now, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.22,0:08:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Your big sister pudding is getting\Nmarried tomorrow, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:08:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have a delicious wedding\Ncake, big enough for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray! Hooray! Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, this should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.56,0:09:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to meet the\NGroob's family. D 'or!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.90,0:09:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma, ma, ma, ma, ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.42,0:09:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's truly a pleasure to have\Nyou here, Jeremiah Double Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.24,0:09:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry if I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a little hiccup to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything should be peachy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.34,0:09:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon the delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I've heard so\Nmuch about Sanji already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence that he's a chef.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, he's a perfect match for my Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they're getting married\Neither way, so it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is strictly a political arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.80,0:10:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's lovely that we can find something\Nthat works to our mutual benefit, Judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.46,0:10:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it would make me even happier\Nif our children could share in the joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give them a perfect wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.00,0:10:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A toast to their future.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Black tea, green tea, choose please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.48,0:10:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, black? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.88,0:11:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a bite, also nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.18,0:11:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Liza, please start with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.54,0:11:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a bite, also nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Liza, won't you start with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.16,0:11:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know just a thing you need,\Nhave a bit of sweet, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.18,0:11:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.74,0:11:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I usually don't hate food, but I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Noisiest damn food I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't it taste so yummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.24,0:12:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.92,0:12:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We are kaput.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.78,0:12:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We are Gatling, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.74,0:12:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.08,0:13:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.98,0:13:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, please. You just need to get\Nout of here and hide for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.30,0:13:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can come back later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not breaking your word,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.40,0:13:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't go—what happens if Saji\Ncomes back here while I'm gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.94,0:13:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, leave this fight to me, Lupi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.46,0:13:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is impossible—we're in the\Nmiddle of an emperor's territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,emperor's territory
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an entire army!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.70,0:14:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Shawhead Nico is now in sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.04,0:14:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him I would be here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't break my promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You led my friends to this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.06,0:14:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave Luffy my word that I\Nwould bring you to the southwest
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.96,0:14:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,coast so you would be able\Nto get away from Mama safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.28,0:14:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't make it happen, and\Nnow they're all in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.56,0:14:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.26,0:15:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered how they managed to pass\Nthrough all that security to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It was thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you meant well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.68,0:15:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, no matter what, I still\Nwouldn't have gone to the coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.86,0:15:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're worried about the invitation,\Nyou can let me take the blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.10,0:15:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.01,0:15:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't show up at the ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's used to arranged marriages,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,so she puts special bracelets on people\Nwho seem like they might run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.96,0:15:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you try to leave the island\Nwith one, I know it explodes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mom has the key to unlock this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If I want to get it, then I have\Nto defeat the big mom pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.80,0:15:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So she's already gotten to you, sadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.12,0:15:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's thinking ahead, and\Neven if that weren't the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,no one here has my back,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.42,0:16:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,even
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.72,0:16:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,though
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.63,0:16:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we're brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.52,0:16:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They still did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.54,0:16:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your own family beat you that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.32,0:16:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Because to them, I'm just a failure\Nwho shouldn't be allowed to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.16,0:16:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never once been happy\Nabout being born as royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the reason I went out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching for a place I\Nwasn't even sure was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.74,0:16:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,if I try to prevent\Nthis arranged marriage,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll slaughter all my friends and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:17:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,On top of that, they're going to kill the\Nman in the East Blue who saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.68,0:17:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who I respect as my real father.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.72,0:17:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what I do at this\Npoint, there's no way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.06,0:17:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why I've decided that\NI won't fight this anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm willing to accept this\Nmarriage on one condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.48,0:17:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I want Big Mom to let\Nmy friends go unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Our soldiers are out there\Nattacking as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.32,0:17:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in such pain,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.74,0:17:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's all because of what I did,\Npudding—it's not your fault. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.80,0:17:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,13
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.80,0:17:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I managed to escape hell only\Nto walk right back in again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.92,0:18:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I should try to be happy after all—I\Nwas free for all of these years, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.12,0:18:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The friends
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.34,0:18:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,who helped me improve as a chef, and the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.66,0:18:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,companions who joined me in my travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.82,0:18:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,to all of the people I met out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.24,0:18:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And I
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.56,0:18:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,can't bear to hurt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.10,0:18:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.66,0:18:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,my adventure ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.06,0:18:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.97,0:18:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me feel worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,feel worse
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.36,0:18:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.76,0:18:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.32,0:18:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you decide to marry me,\NI won't let it be hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.82,0:19:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dear, what am I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.82,0:19:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're suffering so much and\NI'm making everything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.12,0:19:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to marry me, so of\Ncourse this would be hell for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I being so insensitive\Nat a time like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.78,0:19:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's awful. I'm so embarrassed. After\Nall, you and I have only just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so how could I possibly hope to fill the\Nhole in your heart, and besides all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You still might change your mind,\Nso I was being presumptuous, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my salvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.16,0:20:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding, if you'll have me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.08,0:20:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I want us to get married tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.92,0:20:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.02,0:20:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Get down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.32,0:20:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.86,0:20:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look like anything special,\Nso I wasn't expecting power like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should have paid\Nbetter attention to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.76,0:21:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bane's Blade
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirado, but I'm innocent, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you've got to believe me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Amad, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Amad, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now slow, bow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.34,0:21:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:21:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.61,0:21:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.74,0:22:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you at least cut me down quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to finish you off in one\Nswing, there wouldn't be any point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.06,0:22:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I sliced through my enemies\Nas slowly and painfully as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.32,0:22:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You are something else, Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.42,0:22:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You stayed up all night long fighting\Nwith our big brother Cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.04,0:22:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And it hasn't slowed you down one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.72,0:22:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Those chest peacekeepers\Nare pretty sturdy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.58,0:22:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're tearing right through them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.48,0:22:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, come with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.68,0:22:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The cream monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.22,0:22:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's burning!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.44,0:23:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet cream is always best\Nwhen it's fresh and piping hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.32,0:23:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And by the time the cream\Nreaches the perfect temperature,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.78,0:23:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,your entire body will be\Ntoasted like a marshmallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.88,0:23:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.26,0:23:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, kid, but that one's\Nnot gonna work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.60,0:23:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Elephant Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.44,0:23:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.52,0:23:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.88,0:24:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And I welcome you to the World of Books!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.52,0:24:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I keep getting burned!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.86,0:24:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.44,0:24:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.62,0:24:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.48,0:24:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.76,0:24:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.08,0:25:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy! Here they come!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.16,0:25:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.80,0:25:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.12,0:25:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,King Baal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.08,0:26:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The chess peacekeepers\Nhappen to be homies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.82,0:26:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,so this explains why\Nthey couldn't defeat you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.12,0:26:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,it also tells us how\Nyou were able to escape
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.70,0:26:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,from the seducing woods\Neverything makes sense
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.30,0:26:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,now how in the hell did you\Nget your hands on mama's vibre
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.52,0:26:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,card it has lola's name on\Nit what did you just say our
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.00,0:26:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,lola did you steal it from\Nher you mean she's dead the
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.32,0:26:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,girl never should have run\Naway like that lola and why did
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.78,0:26:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,you kill her hold on she gave\Nit to me i'm her friend i
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.88,0:26:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,doubt it yeah try telling mama\Nthat unfortunately our orders
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.82,0:26:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,were to bring you back alive\Nlet's go just look at that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.82,0:26:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,mess almost all of the chest\Npeace keepers were wiped out
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.58,0:27:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I told Sanji, I'd wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.78,0:27:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.74,0:27:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.64,0:27:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, would you like a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.06,0:27:58.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.74,0:28:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here to ask you for a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.08,0:28:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry about the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.56,0:28:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The crew members you're currently\Naligned with will be free to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.62,0:28:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise I'll give you my word on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.64,0:28:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget the idea of running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.58,0:28:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Marry my daughter without making a fuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.30,0:28:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And poof, it'll be like nothing ever has.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.40,0:28:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.48,0:28:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll do everything\NI can to make pudding happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.58,0:28:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Your head over heels in love\Nwith my little girl, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.10,0:28:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It warms my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.34,0:28:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But let me make this clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.28,0:28:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats have done a\Ntruly unspeakable thing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.26,0:28:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Under normal circumstances,\NI'd make sure they pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.98,0:29:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They have destroyed my seducing woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.78,0:29:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And defeated one of my\Nthree sweet generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.58,0:29:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, back on Fishman Island,\Nyour captain devoured my candies!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.66,0:29:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and had the gall to pick a fight with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.14,0:29:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's all in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.30,0:29:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, your wedding\Nis my top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.36,0:29:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it's a success,\Nthen by this time tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.96,0:29:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,all of Jerma's forces will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.56,0:29:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And then right after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.36,0:29:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,we will all get to celebrate together by\Ntucking into a big, delicious wedding cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.00,0:29:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you don't run away, Hey, the\Nwhole situation will tidy up nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.16,0:29:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.08,0:29:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.04,0:30:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Supposition, there are 30 or so of these\Nbonoglyphs scattered out travers le Monda.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.36,0:30:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Their inscriptions, carved on stone\Ntablets, Kuma. Vice voyez ici,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.14,0:30:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,have remained unbroken\Nfor hundreds of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.14,0:30:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Only nine of those certain monoglyphs\Nhave l 'information spécifique,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.32,0:30:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but they are très important to bear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.02,0:30:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,For, if you take their\Nmassage to the final island,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.44,0:30:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Laugh-tell, then the truth of the world\Nwill be revealed, selon la légende!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.52,0:30:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.18,0:30:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,General Smoothie, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.42,0:30:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.33,0:30:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Have mercy, General Smoothie!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.86,0:30:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,General Smoothie!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.20,0:31:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,However, in order to actually\Nreach Laugh Tale en premier lieu,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.14,0:31:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You need something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.28,0:31:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The four road Poneglyph,\Nwhich are colored red.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.56,0:31:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Recently, Jinbe delivered\None to us, as you may know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.40,0:31:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A gift for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.92,0:31:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I just picked it up by chance. Like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.92,0:31:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So, au total, the big mom pirate possess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.78,0:31:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Two ordinary poneglyphs\Nand an road poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.02,0:31:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Three stones precious carefully\Nsealed away right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.32,0:31:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the stones are\Nimportant. I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.70,0:31:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My question is, why did you tighten security\Nall of a sudden with no explanation?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.70,0:31:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I mind guarding them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.40,0:31:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm free. Till the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.86,0:31:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Merci.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.77,0:31:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize for calling you so suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.08,0:31:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But we're dealing with a former pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.58,0:32:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,captain who came to this\Nisland five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.56,0:32:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,His objective during his last unwelcome\Nvisit was to steal Poneglyphs,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.40,0:32:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so we may assume the sneaky meek\Nis attempting the same again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.86,0:32:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.14,0:32:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He was only spared because his\Ncompagnon becomes begged for his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.50,0:32:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,so his decision to return is\Nboth confounding and foolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.28,0:32:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Pedro?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.64,0:32:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,One might say,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.84,0:32:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the road upon the glyphs are la plus\Ngrande importance to any pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.96,0:32:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can become king of\Nthe pirates with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.84,0:32:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A quest worthy of the four emperors,\Nn 'est-ce pas, sweet general smoothie?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.54,0:32:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,On conclusion,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.82,0:32:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,we must take every\Nprecaution possible and put
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.50,0:32:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,our very lives on the land\Nto protect these storms.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.64,0:33:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.88,0:33:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.86,0:33:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They called in more guards? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.82,0:33:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman with long legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.70,0:33:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Frightening, but lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.24,0:33:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name's Smoothie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.76,0:33:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,A sweet general, they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.64,0:33:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, I feared as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.36,0:33:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She did look quite imposing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.30,0:33:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All hope is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.40,0:33:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Even at night, we wouldn't have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.96,0:33:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not with their security like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.58,0:33:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Our last chance vanished the instant\Nthat Baron Tamago noticed I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.70,0:33:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Things haven't gone\Nquite smoothly for Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.50,0:33:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So it would have been nice if our\Nplan had been successful, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.48,0:33:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I was rather touched by\Nwhat you said before we came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.68,0:34:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If Luffy really is going to\Nbecome the king of the pirates,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.90,0:34:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,then he'll need that road\Nponeglyph eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.96,0:34:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to face that fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.98,0:34:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, if we retreat from here\Nnow, it would be hard to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.28,0:34:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.32,0:34:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you and I have made it all the way to\Nour destination without a single fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.50,0:34:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If we tried again later, there's\Nno guarantee we'd have such luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.20,0:34:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,True enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.60,0:34:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So even if things look dicey, this could\Nbe a once in a lifetime chance for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.44,0:34:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, if we attack, we'll both be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.62,0:34:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is Baron Tamago's target?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.72,0:34:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.76,0:34:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you could serve as the bait, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.44,0:35:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was just\Nthinking the same thing.
